Dear Students and Recent Graduates,

Applications are now officially open for the upcoming Industry-Oriented Technical Training & Internship Program. Designed for undergraduate and postgraduate students of all academic years and recent graduates, this 3-month online initiative focuses on core programming logic, practical project execution, and targeted preparation for national-level corporate assessments (including TCS NQT and CodeVita).

Application & Registration Procedure
Interested candidates are invited to complete the formal registration form. Input the designated program reference code to finalize submission.

- Reference Code: ION30
- Application Link: https://forms.gle/gHcG8qiGDfLw7PYt7

Program Details
- Duration: 3 Months (2 Months Training + 1 Month Project Internship)
- Delivery Mode: 100% Online (Work from Home / LMS Platform)
- Eligibility: All academic years and streams, as well as recent graduates.

Structured Curriculum Roadmap
Month 1: Technical Foundations & Assessment Readiness
- Mentor-Led Instruction: Interactive weekday sessions focusing on core programming, data structures, and analytical problem-solving.
- Assessment Framework: Continuous progress evaluations aligned with standard national corporate hiring benchmarks.

Month 2: Practical Application & Career Readiness
- Hands-on Projects: Development of individual and team-based technical assignments with industry-standard documentation.
- Career Development: Resume optimization modules and automated mock technical interview practice.

Month 3: Project-Based Internship
- Corporate Integration: Transition into real-world technical workflows, task execution, and client deliverable management.
- Performance Incentives: Evaluation-based stipend opportunities available upon meeting project deliverables and quality metrics.

Professional Credentials & Career Outcomes
- Verified Certification: Course Completion Certificate and Internship Certificate upon meeting program requirements.
- Special Recognition: Performance-backed Letter of Recommendation (LOR) for top candidates.

Support Desk
For curriculum details, fee structures, or scheduling inquiries, please reach out to the Operations Team:
- Contact Numbers: 6281695201 / 9908215552

